:description: Runs the firmware (compiled with uart debug flag set) and saves the log+uart output to a logfile.

logFile @logfile.log true
logLevel 3 file

include @scripts/single-node/crazyflie.resc

# This causes the debug output from the firmware sent to usart3 to appear as error logging
# This allows ouptut that a build pipeline could examine to evaluate success of a firmware run
# Logging it as Error might not be the best long term solution, Info might be better to allows
# easier disambiguation between these console outputs and actual error messages.
sysbus.usart3 AddLineHook "" "Antmicro.Renode.Logging.Logger.Log(LogLevel.Error, line)"

# This is the line that indicates successful initialization of the normal crazyflie2 firmware
sysbus.usart3 AddLineHook "Free heap" "Antmicro.Renode.Emulator.Exit()"

# This line was used in testing because the previous one was after an infinite loop in the initialization
# that I couldn't find a solution to.
# sysbus.usart3 AddLineHook "of flash" "Antmicro.Renode.Emulator.Exit()"

start
